OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 awards multi-year
OL,4,Cplayout contract to Encompass
OL,5,
OL,6,FChannel 4 has appointed Encompass
OL,7,FDigital Media to provide its managed
OL,8,Flinear playout services under a new
OL,9,Fmulti-year agreement, following a
OL,10,Fprocurement and evaluation process run
OL,11,Fby the broadcaster.
OL,13,FThe new contract comes into effect in
OL,14,F2027.
OL,16,FThe contract covers channel
OL,17,Forigination, content supply chain and
OL,18,Fdisaster recovery across Channel 4's
OL,19,Fportfolio: Channel 4, E4, More4, Film4,
OL,20,FE4 Extra and 4seven.
OL,23,EPub: 28-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
