OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F146A1786903897
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 awards multi-year
OL,4,Cplayout contract to Encompass
OL,5,
OL,6,FEncompass says the services will be
OL,7,Fdelivered from its broadcast facilities
OL,8,Fin London and Riga, using its
OL,9,Fcloud-native Altitude platform,
OL,10,Fincluding the Altitude Playout and
OL,11,FAltitude Flow products.
OL,13,FThe company describes the platform as
OL,14,Fsoftware-defined and remote-first, an
OL,15,Farchitecture it says is intended to
OL,16,Fgive the broadcaster operational
OL,17,Fflexibility as playout and distribution
OL,18,Fmethods change.
OL,23,EPub: 28-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,147,140,200,120,0,100
