PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F146A1786903897
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/4
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 awards multi-year
OL,4,Cplayout contract to Encompass
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarc Bruce, CEO of Encompass, said
OL,7,FChannel 4 had run a rigorous
OL,8,Fprocurement process and that the
OL,9,Fcompany was pleased to have been
OL,10,Fselected, adding that the agreement
OL,11,Freflected its experience supporting
OL,12,Fbroadcasters with resilient managed
OL,13,Fservices.
OL,15,FGrace Boswood, director of technology
OL,16,Fand distribution at Channel 4, said
OL,17,FEncompass's cloud-native technology and
OL,18,Fits experience with modern broadcast
OL,19,Fenvironments made it a suitable choice
OL,20,Ffor the broadcaster's future
OL,21,Frequirements.
OL,23,EPub: 28-Jul-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
