OL,3,GNEWSCChannel 4 awards multi-year
OL,4,Cplayout contract to Encompass
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeither party has disclosed the value
OL,7,For precise length of the new agreement.
OL,9,FChannel 4's linear playout is currently
OL,10,Fhandled by Red Bee Media.
